{"id":401206101,"chapter_id":21000102,"scene_id":205,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"枷锁狂暴地撕裂这个空间，撕碎每一个靠近你的虫怪，破坏虫巢，如复仇一般。","style":3,"background":2133,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"content":"但真正的仇人却轻飘飘飞在空中，笑看这一切，等着你逐渐耗尽。","style":3,"background":2133,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"曼缇斯虫后","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>我喜欢你的力量。</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_401206101_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_12061","style":1,"background":2133,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"曼缇斯虫后","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>更重要的是，对同伴的执着。</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_401206101_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_12061","style":1,"background":2133,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"曼缇斯虫后","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>她也一样，偏执，又疯狂。</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_401206101_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_12061","style":1,"background":2133,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"曼缇斯虫后","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>坚持不被人相信的猜想，长久注视深渊，不断靠近我，跟我对话——在我身上寻找逝去之人的可能。</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_401206101_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_12061","style":1,"background":2133,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"曼缇斯虫后","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>但那不是真正的同伴。</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_401206101_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_12061","style":1,"background":2133,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"content":"她抬手，又一波虫群向你袭来，突破枷锁将你撞倒在地。","style":3,"background":2133,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"曼缇斯虫后","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>同伴是我们的力量，更多的同伴让我们变得更强，生物结伴是为了生存，而不是相反——</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_401206101_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_12061","style":1,"background":2133,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"曼缇斯虫后","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>她早觉醒了强大的力量，她本可以得到更多，却为“同伴”冒太多险，停滞不前，也就止步于此。</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_401206101_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_12061","style":1,"background":2133,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"曼缇斯虫后","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>要学会接受它们的死亡呀，怎么失去了它们，人类就变得如此弱小呢？</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_401206101_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_12061","style":1,"background":2133,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"content":"她缓缓飞落你身前，向你伸手。","style":3,"background":2133,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"options":["怪物！你杀了她！"],"jump":[14],"style":6,"background":2133,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"content":"本已力竭的你爆发最后的力量，赤光咆哮着向那怪物刺去，要杀了它，必须杀了它！","style":3,"background":2133,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"content":"可在即将刺穿她的瞬间，那个人变了，面具脱落，污染退去，变成一个你熟悉的脸，你听到熟悉的声音。","style":3,"background":2133,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"content":"光刺停住了，这反应不经过你的理性，它来自本能——你无法对“同伴”动手，哪怕只有一瞬的犹豫。","style":3,"background":2133,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"speaker":"“曼缇斯”","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>你跟她真的很像，她也露出过跟你一样的表情。</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_401206101_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_12061","style":1,"background":2133,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"content":"哧——！","style":3,"background":2133,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"content":"尖刺刺穿你的身体，枷锁碎了。","style":3,"background":2133,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"speaker":"“曼缇斯”","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>同伴不该成为你们的软肋。你们都被虚假之物拖累太久，现在……我帮你。</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_401206101_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_12061","style":1,"background":2133,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"speaker":"“曼缇斯”","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>成为我的同伴吧。</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_401206101_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_12061","style":1,"background":2133,"log_type":1}]}